rees along Myrstigen hiking trail in winter, Brastad, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden. After days of very strong winds, when all the snow was blown from trees and structures, came a few days of calm and cold weather. This formed hoar frost on all surfaces and on the third day, it had accumulated into a thick layer on everything. The only snow was on the ground, so all the \"white\" covering trees, plants and structures in the photo is hoar frost."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2024-01-10 13:16:29"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:W.carter\" title=\"User:W.carter\">W.carter</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":147973416,"title":"File:Hochheide Neuer Hagen.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Hochheide_Neuer_Hagen.jpg/960px-Hochheide_Neuer_Hagen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hochheide_Neuer_Hagen.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Heath on the northern slope of the Clemensberg in the Sauerland."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2024-03-31 13:50:05"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Milseburg\" title=\"User:Milseburg\">Jörg Braukmann</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":164599146,"title":"File:Hochries, Alpes del Chiemgau, Alemania, 2024-10-19, DD 28-30 HDR.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Hochries%2C_Alpes_del_Chiemgau%2C_Alemania%2C_2024-10-19%2C_DD_28-30_HDR.jpg/960px-Hochries%2C_Alpes_del_Chiemgau%2C_Alemania%2C_2024-10-19%2C_DD_28-30_HDR.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hochries,_Alpes_del_Chiemgau,_Alemania,_2024-10-19,_DD_28-30_HDR.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Summit cross on top of the 1,569 metres (5,